{title: Saare Jahan Se Achha}
{artist: Se Achha}
{key: Em}

{c: Verse 1}
[Em]Saare Jahaan Se Accha
[E]Hindustaan Hamaara
[E]Ham Bulbulain Hai Is Ki,
[E]Yeh [Em]Gulsitaan Hamaara
[Em]Yeh Gulsitaan Hamaara
[E]Parvat [A]Woh Sab [E]Se Ooncha,
[E]Hamsaaya Aasmaan Ka
[E]Woh Santri Hamaara,
[E]Woh [Em]Paasbaan Hamaara
[E]Godi Mein Khelti Hain
[E]Is Ki Hazaaron Nadiyaan
[A]Gulshan Hai Jis [E]Ke Dam Se
[E]Rashk E [Em]Jahaan Hamaraaaa
[B]Mazhab [E]Nahi Sikhaata
[E]Aapas Mein Beyr Rakhna
[E]Hindi Hain Ham Watan Hai,
[E]Hindoostaan [Em]Hamaara
